**views/square.erb**
```html
<h1>Square</h1>
<form action="/square/results" method="get">
  <label for="user_number">Enter a number</label>
  <input id="user_number" name="user_number" type="text" placeholder="What number do you want to square?">
  <button type="submit">Calculate square</button>
</form>
```

**views/square_results.erb**
```html
<h1>Square Results</h1>
<p><strong>Number:</strong> <%= user_number %></p>
<p><strong>Square:</strong> <%= square %></p>
<p><a href="/square/new">Calculate another square</a></p>
```

