**views/payment.erb**
```html
<h1>Payment</h1>
<form action="/payment/results" method="get">
  <label for="apr">APR</label>
  <input id="apr" name="apr" type="text" placeholder="E.g. 5.42">

  <label for="years">Number of years</label>
  <input id="years" name="years" type="text" placeholder="How many years to repay?">

  <label for="principal">Principal</label>
  <input id="principal" name="principal" type="text" placeholder="How much principal?">

  <button type="submit">Calculate monthly payment</button>
</form>
```

**views/payment_results.erb**
```html
<h1>Payment Results</h1>
<p><strong>APR:</strong> <%= formatted_apr %></p>
<p><strong>Number of years:</strong> <%= years %></p>
<p><strong>Principal:</strong> <%= formatted_principal %></p>
<p><strong>Monthly payment:</strong> <%= monthly_payment %></p>
<p><a href="/payment/new">Calculate another payment</a></p>
